                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "This page is for people joining a documentation project that already uses Antora."
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "strong",
                "roles": []
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "A playbook is usually located in a playbook project. A playbook project repository is responsible for generating a documentation site. It’s strictly a "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "configuration as code"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "emphasis",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " repository—​it does not contain any content. Instead, it contains a playbook file, and, in certain situations, supplemental UI files and extension code."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Before you can generate a site with Antora, you’ll need to fetch the playbook project for your site."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "preamble",
        "id": null,
        "outline": null,
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "To start, open a terminal and clone the playbook project using git:"
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "literal",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "$ git clone your-playbook-repo && cd \"`basename $_`\""
              }
            ],
            "language": null,
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The command clones an existing playbook project and then switches to the project folder."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "If the project contains a "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "package-lock.json"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "emphasis",
                "roles": [
                  "path"
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " file, it means it is requesting that you install Antora locally. To do so, run the following command:"
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "literal",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "$ npm ci"
              }
            ],
            "language": null,
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "When Antora is installed locally, you will use "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "npx antora"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " to run Antora install of "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "antora"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ". The "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "npx"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " command will look for the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "antora"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " command installed within the playbook project or any parent directory of the playbook project."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
